  "description": "WOSFIV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: 0.82(C37 H50 Dy4 Fe2 N10 O32),3(C1 H4 O1),0.36(H2 O1),0.18(C35 H46 Dy4 Fe2 N10 O32). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 13 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.008-4.398 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.72-145.44°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Fe2Dy4(μ4-O)2(μ3-OH)2.36(μ3-OMe)1.64(O2CCH2CN)10(MeOH)5(H2O)]·0.36H2O·3MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
